  "type": "songs",
  "content": "<div class=\"page-links\">Pages: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/songs/twist-and-shout/\" class=\"post-page-numbers\"><span class=\"page-link\">1</span></a> <span class=\"post-page-numbers current\" aria-current=\"page\"><span class=\"page-link\">2</span></span></div><div id=\"ez-toc-container\" class=\"ez-toc-v2_0_89 ez-toc-wrap-right counter-hierarchy ez-toc-counter ez-toc-grey ez-toc-container-direction\"><div class=\"ez-toc-title-container\"><p class=\"ez-toc-title\" style=\"cursor:inherit\">Contents</p>\n<span class=\"ez-toc-title-toggle\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"ez-toc-pull-right ez-toc-btn ez-toc-btn-xs ez-toc-btn-default ez-toc-toggle\" aria-label=\"Toggle Table of Content\"><span class=\"ez-toc-js-icon-con\"><span class=\"\"><span class=\"eztoc-hide\" style=\"display:none;\">Toggle</span><span class=\"ez-toc-icon-toggle-span\"><svg style=\"fill: #999;color:#999\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"list-377408\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M6 6H4v2h2V6zm14 0H8v2h12V6zM4 11h2v2H4v-2zm16 0H8v2h12v-2zM4 16h2v2H4v-2zm16 0H8v2h12v-2z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path></svg><svg style=\"fill: #999;color:#999\" class=\"arrow-unsorted-368013\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"10px\" height=\"10px\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" version=\"1.2\" baseProfile=\"tiny\"><path d=\"M18.2 9.3l-6.2-6.3-6.2 6.3c-.2.2-.3.4-.3.7s.1.5.3.7c.2.2.4.3.7.3h11c.3 0 .5-.1.7-.3.2-.2.3-.5.3-.7s-.1-.5-.3-.7zM5.8 14.7l6.2 6.3 6.2-6.3c.2-.2.3-.5.3-.7s-.1-.5-.3-.7c-.2-.2-.4-.3-.7-.3h-11c-.3 0-.5.1-.7.3-.2.2-.3.5-.3.7s.1.5.3.7z\"/></svg></span></span></span></a></span></div><nav><ul class='ez-toc-list ez-toc-list-level-1 eztoc-toggle-hide-by-default' ><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-1\" href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/songs/twist-and-shout/#Personnel\" >Personnel</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-2\" href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/songs/twist-and-shout/#In_the_studio\" >In the studio</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-3\" href=\"#Chart_success\" >Chart success</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-4\" href=\"#BBC_recordings\" >BBC recordings</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-5\" href=\"#Lyrics\" >Lyrics</a></li></ul></nav></div><h2><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"Chart_success\"></span>Chart success<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2><p>&#8216;Twist And Shout&#8217; was released as a single in the US on <a href=\"/1964/03/02/us-single-twist-and-shout/\">2 March 1964</a> by the Tollie label. It reached number two on the <em>Billboard</em> chart.</p><p>In the UK the song was the title track of The Beatles&#8217; first EP, which topped the charts following its release on <a href=\"/1963/07/12/uk-release-twist-and-shout-ep/\">12 July 1963</a>. The other songs on the EP were <a href=\"/songs/a-taste-of-honey/\">&#8216;A Taste Of Honey&#8217;</a>, <a href=\"/songs/do-you-want-to-know-a-secret/\">&#8216;Do You Want To Know A Secret&#8217;</a>, and <a href=\"/songs/theres-a-place/\">&#8216;There&#8217;s A Place&#8217;</a>.</p><p>In Canada &#8216;Twist And Shout&#8217; was the title track of the second Beatles album released by Capitol. It was issued on 3 February 1964.</p><div data-carousel-extra='{&quot;blog_id&quot;:1,&quot;permalink&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatlesbible.com/songs/twist-and-shout/&quot;}' id='gallery-1' class='gallery galleryid-293 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-thumbnail'><figure class='gallery-item'><div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n<a href='https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/uk_twist-and-shout-ep/'><img decoding=\"sync\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/uk_twist-and-shout-ep-200x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Twist And Shout EP artwork - United Kingdom\" srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/uk_twist-and-shout-ep-200x200.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/uk_twist-and-shout-ep-580x580.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/uk_twist-and-shout-ep-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/uk_twist-and-shout-ep.jpg 585w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"10208\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/uk_twist-and-shout-ep/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/uk_twist-and-shout-ep.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"585,585\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Twist And Shout EP artwork \u2013 United Kingdom\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/uk_twist-and-shout-ep.jpg\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></a></div></figure><figure class='gallery-item'><div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n<a href='https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/denmark_twist_and_shout/'><img decoding=\"sync\" width=\"200\" height=\"198\" src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/denmark_twist_and_shout-200x198.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Twist And Shout single artwork - Denmark\" srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/denmark_twist_and_shout-200x198.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/denmark_twist_and_shout-580x573.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/denmark_twist_and_shout-960x948.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/denmark_twist_and_shout-768x759.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/denmark_twist_and_shout-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/denmark_twist_and_shout.jpg 1000w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"9277\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/denmark_twist_and_shout/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/denmark_twist_and_shout.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1000,988\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Twist And Shout single artwork \u2013 Denmark\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/denmark_twist_and_shout-960x948.jpg\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></a></div></figure><figure class='gallery-item'><div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n<a href='https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/usa_twist_and_shout/'><img decoding=\"sync\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/usa_twist_and_shout-200x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Twist And Shout single artwork - USA\" srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/usa_twist_and_shout-200x200.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/usa_twist_and_shout-580x580.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/usa_twist_and_shout-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/usa_twist_and_shout.jpg 700w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"10268\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/usa_twist_and_shout/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/usa_twist_and_shout.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"700,700\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Twist And Shout single artwork \u2013 USA\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/usa_twist_and_shout.jpg\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></a></div></figure><figure class='gallery-item'><div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n<a href='https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/japan_twist_and_shout/'><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/japan_twist_and_shout-200x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Twist And Shout single artwork - Japan\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/japan_twist_and_shout-200x200.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/japan_twist_and_shout-580x577.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/japan_twist_and_shout-960x954.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/japan_twist_and_shout-768x763.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/japan_twist_and_shout-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/japan_twist_and_shout.jpg 1000w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"9604\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/japan_twist_and_shout/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/japan_twist_and_shout.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1000,994\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Twist And Shout single artwork \u2013 Japan\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/japan_twist_and_shout-960x954.jpg\" /></a></div></figure><figure class='gallery-item'><div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n<a href='https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/japan_twist_and_shout_ep/'><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTk3IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDE5NyI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"197\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/japan_twist_and_shout_ep-200x197.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Twist And Shout EP artwork - Japan\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/japan_twist_and_shout_ep-200x197.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/japan_twist_and_shout_ep-580x572.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/japan_twist_and_shout_ep-960x948.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/japan_twist_and_shout_ep-768x758.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/japan_twist_and_shout_ep-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/japan_twist_and_shout_ep.jpg 1000w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"9603\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/japan_twist_and_shout_ep/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/japan_twist_and_shout_ep.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1000,987\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Twist And Shout EP artwork \u2013 Japan\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/japan_twist_and_shout_ep-960x948.jpg\" /></a></div></figure><figure class='gallery-item'><div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n<a href='https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/brazil_twist_and_shout_ep/'><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTk3IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDE5NyI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"197\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/brazil_twist_and_shout_ep-200x197.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Twist And Shout EP artwork - Brazil\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/brazil_twist_and_shout_ep-200x197.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/brazil_twist_and_shout_ep-580x571.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/brazil_twist_and_shout_ep-960x945.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/brazil_twist_and_shout_ep-768x756.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/brazil_twist_and_shout_ep-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/brazil_twist_and_shout_ep.jpg 1000w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"9194\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/brazil_twist_and_shout_ep/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/brazil_twist_and_shout_ep.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1000,984\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Twist And Shout EP artwork \u2013 Brazil\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/brazil_twist_and_shout_ep-960x945.jpg\" /></a></div></figure></div><h2><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"BBC_recordings\"></span>BBC recordings<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2><p>The Beatles recorded &#8216;Twist And Shout&#8217; a total of ten times for BBC radio.</p><p>The earliest was for the BBC&#8217;s <em>Talent Spot</em> radio show on <a href=\"/1962/11/27/radio-the-talent-spot/\">27 November 1962</a> at the corporation&#8217;s Paris Studio, London. It was broadcast on 4 December 1962, but the recording is now lost. The Beatles also recorded <a href=\"/songs/love-me-do/\">&#8216;Love Me Do&#8217;</a> and <a href=\"/songs/ps-i-love-you/\">&#8216;PS I Love You&#8217;</a> for the show.</p><p>The second recording was for <em>Swinging Sound 63</em> on <a href=\"/1963/04/18/paul-mccartney-meets-jane-asher/\">18 April 1963</a>, the day <a href=\"/people/paul-mccartney/\">Paul McCartney</a> met <a href=\"/people/jane-asher/\">Jane Asher</a>. The Beatles taped just two songs for the show, which was broadcast live \u2013\u00a0the other was <a href=\"/songs/from-me-to-you/\">&#8216;From Me To You&#8217;</a>.</p><p>On <a href=\"/1963/05/21/radio-saturday-club-steppin-out/\">21 May 1963</a> they made an appearance on <em>Steppin&#8217; Out</em>, which was broadcast on 3 June. The other songs recorded that day were <a href=\"/songs/please-please-me/\">&#8216;Please Please Me&#8217;</a>, <a href=\"/songs/i-saw-her-standing-there/\">&#8216;I Saw Her Standing There&#8217;</a>, <a href=\"/songs/roll-over-beethoven/\">&#8216;Roll Over Beethoven&#8217;</a>, <a href=\"/songs/thank-you-girl/\">&#8216;Thank You Girl&#8217;</a>, and &#8216;From Me To You&#8217;.</p><p>The Beatles&#8217; fourth BBC recording of &#8216;Twist And Shout&#8217; was made on <a href=\"/1963/06/17/radio-pop-go-the-beatles-4/\">17 June 1963</a>, for an edition of <em>Pop Go The Beatles</em> broadcast on 25 June. They also taped versions of &#8216;Anna (Go To Him)&#8217;, &#8216;I Saw Her Standing There&#8217;, <a href=\"/songs/boys/\">&#8216;Boys&#8217;</a>, <a href=\"/songs/chains/\">&#8216;Chains&#8217;</a>, <a href=\"/songs/ps-i-love-you/\">&#8216;PS I Love You&#8217;</a>, and <a href=\"/songs/a-taste-of-honey/\">&#8216;A Taste Of Honey&#8217;</a>.</p><p>On <a href=\"/1963/07/03/radio-the-beat-show/\">3 July 1963</a> they recorded an appearance on <em>The Beat Show</em>, which was broadcast the following day. The Beatles taped just three songs: &#8216;From Me To You&#8217;, &#8216;A Taste Of Honey&#8217;, and &#8216;Twist And Shout&#8217;.</p><p>The sixth BBC recording was made on <a href=\"/1963/07/16/radio-pop-go-the-beatles-8-9-10/\">16 July 1963</a> for <em>Pop Go The Beatles</em>, and was broadcast on 6 August. The Beatles also recorded versions of <a href=\"/songs/im-gonna-sit-right-down-and-cry-over-you/\">&#8216;I&#8217;m Gonna Sit Right Down And Cry (Over You)&#8217;</a>, <a href=\"/songs/crying-waiting-hoping/\">&#8216;Crying, Waiting, Hoping&#8217;</a>, <a href=\"/songs/kansas-city-hey-hey-hey-hey/\">&#8216;Kansas City/Hey-Hey-Hey-Hey!&#8217;</a>, <a href=\"/songs/to-know-her-is-to-love-her/\">&#8216;To Know Her Is To Love Her&#8217;</a>, <a href=\"/songs/the-honeymoon-song/\">&#8216;The Honeymoon Song&#8217;</a>. This day&#8217;s version of &#8216;Twist And Shout&#8217; was included on 2013&#8217;s <a href=\"/albums/on-air-live-at-the-bbc-volume-2/\"><em>On Air \u2013 Live At The BBC Volume 2</em></a>.</p><div class=\"epyt-video-wrapper\"><iframe  id=\"_ytid_71283\"  width=\"580\" height=\"435\"  data-origwidth=\"580\" data-origheight=\"435\"  data-relstop=\"1\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/e0gdJBpOYBY?enablejsapi=1&#038;autoplay=0&#038;cc_load_policy=0&#038;cc_lang_pref=&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;loop=0&#038;rel=0&#038;fs=1&#038;playsinline=0&#038;autohide=2&#038;theme=dark&#038;color=red&#038;controls=1&#038;disablekb=0&#038;\" class=\"__youtube_prefs__  epyt-is-override  no-lazyload\" title=\"YouTube player\"  allow=\"fullscreen; accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen data-no-lazy=\"1\" data-skipgform_ajax_framebjll=\"\"></iframe></div><p>On <a href=\"/1963/07/17/radio-easy-beat-3/\">17 July 1963</a> The Beatles appeared on <em>Easy Beat</em>; the edition was broadcast four days later. They also recorded &#8216;I Saw Her Standing There&#8217;, <a href=\"/songs/a-shot-of-rhythm-and-blues/\">&#8216;A Shot Of Rhythm And Blues&#8217;</a>, and <a href=\"/songs/theres-a-place/\">&#8216;There&#8217;s A Place&#8217;</a>.</p><p>The eighth BBC recording of &#8216;Twist And Shout&#8217; was for <em>Saturday Club</em>. It was recorded on <a href=\"/1963/07/30/radio-non-stop-pop-saturday-club/\">30 July 1963</a> and broadcast on 24 August. The Beatles also taped versions of <a href=\"/songs/long-tall-sally/\">&#8216;Long Tall Sally&#8217;</a>, <a href=\"/songs/she-loves-you/\">&#8216;She Loves You&#8217;</a>, <a href=\"/songs/glad-all-over/\">&#8216;Glad All Over&#8217;</a>, <a href=\"/songs/you-really-got-a-hold-on-me/\">&#8216;You Really Got A Hold On Me&#8217;</a>, and <a href=\"/songs/ill-get-you/\">&#8216;I&#8217;ll Get You&#8217;</a>.</p><p>On <a href=\"/1963/08/01/radio-pop-go-the-beatles-11-12/\">1 August 1963</a> they made another appearance on <em>Pop Go The Beatles</em>, which was broadcast on 27 August. The other songs recorded that day were <a href=\"/songs/ooh-my-soul/\">&#8216;Ooh! My Soul&#8217;</a>, <a href=\"/songs/dont-ever-change/\">&#8216;Don&#8217;t Ever Change&#8217;</a>, &#8216;She Loves You&#8217;, &#8216;Anna (Go To Him)&#8217;, and &#8216;A Shot Of Rhythm And Blues&#8217;.</p><p>The tenth and final BBC recording of &#8216;Twist And Shout&#8217; was again for <em>Pop Go The Beatles</em>. It was recorded on <a href=\"/1963/09/03/radio-pop-go-the-beatles-13-14-15/\">3 September 1963</a> and broadcast on 24 September. The Beatles also taped versions of <a href=\"/songs/ask-me-why/\">&#8216;Ask Me Why&#8217;</a>, <a href=\"/songs/devil-in-her-heart/\">&#8216;Devil In Her Heart&#8217;</a>, &#8216;I Saw Her Standing There&#8217;, and <a href=\"/songs/sure-to-fall-in-love-with-you/\">&#8216;Sure To Fall (In Love With You)&#8217;</a>.</p><p>This final version of &#8216;Twist And Shout&#8217; was released in 2013 on the digital download album <em>Bootleg Recordings 1963</em>.</p><h2><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"Lyrics\"></span>Lyrics<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2><p>Well, shake it up, baby now (shake it up baby)<br />\nTwist and shout (twist and shout)<br />\nC&#8217;mon c&#8217;mon, c&#8217;mon, c&#8217;mon, baby now (come on baby)<br />\nCome on and work it on out (work it on out, whoo)</p><p>Well, work it on out honey (work it on out)<br />\nYou know you look so good (look so good)<br />\nYou know you got me going now (got me going)<br />\nJust like I knew you would (like I knew you would)</p><p>Well, shake it up, baby now (shake it up baby)<br />\nTwist and shout (twist and shout)<br />\nC&#8217;mon, c&#8217;mon, c&#8217;mon, c&#8217;mon, baby now (come on baby)<br />\nCome on and work it on out (work it on out, whoo)</p><p>You know you twist it little girl (twist little girl)<br />\nYou know you twist so fine (twist so fine)<br />\nCome on and twist a little closer now (twist a little closer)<br />\nAnd let me know that you&#8217;re mine (let me know you&#8217;re mine, whoo)</p><p>Well, shake it up, baby now (shake it up baby)<br />\nTwist and shout (twist and shout)<br />\nC&#8217;mon, c&#8217;mon, c&#8217;mon, c&#8217;mon, baby now (come on baby)<br />\nCome on and work it on out (work it on out)</p><p>You know you twist it little girl (twist little girl)<br />\nYou know you twist so fine (twist so fine)<br />\nCome on and twist a little closer now (twist a little closer)<br />\nAnd let me know that you&#8217;re mine (let me know you&#8217;re mine)</p><p>Well shake it, shake it, shake it, baby now (shake it up baby)<br />\nWell shake it, shake it, shake it, baby now (shake it up baby)<br />\nWell shake it, shake it, shake it, baby now (shake it up baby)</p><div class=\"fab-forum-link\"><a href=\"/fab-forum/the-songs/twist-and-shout/\">Discuss &#8216;Twist And Shout&#8217; on the Fab Forum \u00bb</a></div><div class=\"wp-post-navigation\"><div class=\"wp-post-navigation-pre\"> <strong>Previous song:</strong> <a href=\"/songs/theres-a-place/\">&#8216;There&#8217;s A Place&#8217;</a></div><div class=\"wp-post-navigation-next\"> <strong>Next album:</strong> <a href=\"/albums/with-the-beatles/\"><em>With The Beatles</em></a></div></div><div align=\"center\" style=\"clear:both;margin:15px 0;\"></div><div class=\"page-links\">Pages: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/songs/twist-and-shout/\" class=\"post-page-numbers\"><span class=\"page-link\">1</span></a> <span class=\"post-page-numbers current\" aria-current=\"page\"><span class=\"page-link\">2</span></span></div>",
